Page: Portfolio Optimizer
Cat: 🎯
Function: Computes optimal portfolio allocations
Description: Mean-variance optimization engine that maximizes Sharpe ratio, minimizes variance, or applies Black-Litterman models. Supports constraints, benchmarks, and efficient frontier computation.
API: POST /api/v1/optimizer/*
Output: Optimal weights, expected return, volatility, Sharpe ratio
Tuna: 8
